ent-OmuRPObjectiveTeachRealLesson = Teach a Crew Member a Lesson
  .desc = They have made one too many mistakes. It's about time we taught them a lesson they won't forget. Teach them ten fun facts on a space station-related topic of your choice.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePermaThisGuy = Get a Crew Member Into Perma
  .desc = Make sure they are permanently incarcerated. We don't care how you do it. Them showing up at CentComm in cuffs without being a permanent prisoner isn't a job done, but it's better than nothing.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveBorgThisGuy = Turn a Crew Member Into a Cyborg
  .desc = They have said some things to a High Command's personal cyborg they shouldn't have. Show them what it's like by having them turned into a cyborg themself.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveBribery = Bribery
  .desc = Bribe them for their well sought after PDA or job-unique item. It should be no big deal. Make sure it's clean and goes unnoticed.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveDemoteSecurity = Get a Member of Security Fired
  .desc = They pissed off a member of Syndicate High Command, make sure they lose their job. We don't care how you do it, just get it done.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveDemoteCommand = Get a Member of Command Fired
  .desc = They pissed off a member of Syndicate High Command, make sure they lose their job. We don't care how you do it, just get it done.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveSpeciesSwap = Change Someone's Species
  .desc = Nanotrasen staff are too prideful in their appearances. Ensure they return to CentComm as a different species than the one they started the shift as.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveOrganHarvest = Organ Harvesting
  .desc = Get one of their organs and have it on you or in you when you arrive at CentComm. They are a perfect match for the boss's niece.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveVoxLungs = Vox Revenge
  .desc = They have been speciesist towards a vox member of High Command. Show them what it's like and make sure whatever body they are in has vox lungs. You'll have to find a donor first.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePrisonerRescue = Recover the Asset
  .desc = A high-value prisoner is being held aboard the station. Locate them, secure their cooperation if necessary, and make sure they survive the shift and escape Nanotrasen custody.

ent-OmuRPObjectivePrisonerAssassination = Terminate the Asset
  .desc = A high-value prisoner aboard the station possesses information that cannot be allowed to reach Central Command. Locate the prisoner and ensure they are dead before the end of the shift.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveFrameMurder = Frame the Target
  .desc = Kill them and pin the blame on someone else, getting them arrested. Our handler is expecting the patsy to arrive at CentComm in cuffs.

ent-OmuRPObjectiveStealNuke = Steal the Nuclear Bomb
